---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { pages } from '../data/research';
const root = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
const href = (part: string) => `${root}${part.replace(/^\//, '')}`;
---
<SiteLayout
  pageType="home"
  title="Seraphine Lore Misinformation: Influencer Cherry-Picking, Google AI and Wikipedia | HUNTtheTRUTH"
  description="Six years of Seraphine lore misinformation: YouTube cherry-picking, creator cross-references, Google AI citations and Riot’s missing source on Wikipedia."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="diamond">◆</span> AN INDEPENDENT INVESTIGATION <span class="diamond">◆</span></p>
      <p class="hero-overline">THE TRUTH IS NEVER WHAT IT SEEMS</p>
      <h1><em>Seraphine Lore</em><span>MISINFORMATION INVESTIGATION</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-rule"><span>✧</span></div>
      <p class="hero-deck">What did influential YouTubers cherry-pick from Riot’s original Seraphine lore?<br /><strong>How did those narratives surface in Google Search and AI while Riot’s first developer explanation went uncited for six years — even on Wikipedia.org?</strong></p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="cta" href={href('seraphine-lore-misinformation-investigation/')}>READ THE FULL MISINFORMATION INVESTIGATION <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={href('sources/')}>EXAMINE THE SOURCES</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom" aria-hidden="true"><span>EXPLORE THE EVIDENCE</span><span>↓</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="premise section-space">
    <div class="container narrow centre">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE INVESTIGATION</p>
      <h2>What Riot <em>published</em> —<br />what influencers <em>left out.</em></h2>
      <p class="large-copy">On 12 October 2020, Riot published <a href="https://www.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/news/dev/champion-insights-seraphine/">Champion Insights: Seraphine</a>. Before the backlash, it established her deep empathy, explained the Brackern souls and explicitly distinguished being unable to rescue them from not caring about them.</p>
      <p>The audit cross-examines NickyBoi, Necrit, T B Skyen, Skooch and ProGuides against Riot’s dated material: missing context, internal contradictions and creator-to-creator endorsements. It then examines what Google Search and AI attributed — and the first Riot source Wikipedia failed to cite for six years.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="evidence-section section-space" id="four-layers">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading centre"><p class="eyebrow">THE EVIDENCE</p><h2>Four parts of the evidence trail</h2><span class="ornament">◆</span></div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <article class="pillar"><span class="pillar-number">I</span><div class="pillar-line"></div><h3>INTENT</h3><p>The 12 October developer account of empathy, Brackern songs and her motives.</p><span class="pillar-meta">12 OCTOBER 2020</span></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="pillar-number">II</span><div class="pillar-line"></div><h3>EXECUTION</h3><p>The disputed Skarner voice line, six biography revisions and Riot’s corrections.</p><span class="pillar-meta">OCTOBER 2020</span></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="pillar-number">III</span><div class="pillar-line"></div><h3>INTERPRETATION</h3><p>YouTube claims, source omissions and demonstrable contradictions.</p><span class="pillar-meta">CREATOR COVERAGE</span></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="pillar-number">IV</span><div class="pillar-line"></div><h3>PROPAGATION</h3><p>Creator cross-references, Google and AI source cards — and Wikipedia’s missing Riot citation.</p><span class="pillar-meta">2020–2026</span></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature section-space">
    <div class="container feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-panel">
        <span class="feature-visual-kicker">PRIMARY SOURCE / 12 OCTOBER 2020</span>
        <div class="feature-sigil" aria-hidden="true">✧<span>◈</span>✧</div>
        <span class="feature-visual-footer">RIOT PUBLISHED IT BEFORE THE ACCUSATIONS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">CHAMPION INSIGHTS: SERAPHINE</p>
        <h2>The source<br /><em>the backlash missed.</em></h2>
        <p>Riot’s own writers established deep empathy, the Brackern’s importance of song and Seraphine’s inability to free trapped souls without implying indifference. This was public on 12 October 2020, before the influencer videos examined in the report.</p>
        <a class="underlined-link" href="https://www.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/news/dev/champion-insights-seraphine/">READ RIOT'S ORIGINAL ARTICLE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-space chapters" id="chapters">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading centre"><p class="eyebrow">EXAMINE THE CLAIMS</p><h2>The accusations. The omissions. The source record.</h2><span class="ornament">◆</span></div>
      <div class="chapter-grid">
        {pages.map((page, index) => (
          <a class="chapter" href={href(`${page.slug}/`)}>
            <span class="chapter-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / {page.eyebrow}</span>
            <h3>{page.title}</h3>
            <p>{page.lead}</p>
            <span class="chapter-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
